{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0345_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0345_story_04_title", "source_sha256": "db5569585afe10390fedf2f522c5d397f9766f69f2243817e7278b686f8c3623", "ja": "○○は控えめに", "zh": "○○适度就好", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0345_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0345_story_04_synopsis", "source_sha256": "0889f573e3dd7b5dcbe9b296ee06175d9bced1f17c58a29ad15836fcd4626148", "ja": "ドラマの撮影が始まる。藍、クロエ、なるは\n順調に出番を終えるが、何もかも初めての\n真珠星は一言の台詞ですら噛んでしまう。\n撮影後、湊から連絡先を交換しようと言われ\n一度は断るも、今後の事を考えて応じる。", "zh": "电视剧的拍摄开始了。藍、クロエ、なる顺利完成了自己的戏份，但第一次面对一切的真珠星，连一句台词都结结巴巴。拍摄结束后，湊提出交换联系方式，她一度拒绝，但考虑到今后的事情，还是答应了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0345_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0345_story_04_1000_020meg", "source_sha256": "b762764f6cc465316e0ceb7b26562e17102fa5bc198a735c394f8326db91ad80", "ja": "そして、ドラマの撮影が始まった。", "zh": "随后，电视剧的拍摄开始了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0345_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0345_story_04_1001_seitokaityou", "source_sha256": "ef199e4be1b9396c58be7ea0a49426b197bd48c7e46b4bf82f6418db1ae8f4ef", "ja": "この学園の生徒会長である俺と、クイーンの君……\nプロムのパートナーに、うってつけだと思わないか？", "zh": "身为这所学校的学生会长的我，和身为女王的你……\n不是很适合做舞会舞伴吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0345_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0345_story_04_1002_018ele", "source_sha256": "c1d4ef778a4dc8b82d930c687fdfb760b694fc8d8b3c0a1c2ad9633646ccae09", "ja": "あら、あなた生徒会長だったの？\nごめんなさい、初めて知ったかも。", "zh": "哎呀，原来你是学生会长啊？\n抱歉，我好像还是第一次知道。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0345_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0345_story_04_1003_018ele", "source_sha256": "3a6b29322377a6b28bd78285ac22cfa99625a537ef0de054a90916d664f24784", "ja": "私をパートナーに誘いたいなら、せめて顔と名前を\n覚えられてからにしてね。わかった？", "zh": "如果你想邀请我做你的搭档，至少也要等到我记住你的长相和名字之后再说。明白了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0345_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0345_story_04_1004_fukukaityou", "source_sha256": "c6d72e73c552701e0566a68abb1e073768fe3e6a56992249c70ce9c6b76ec598", "ja": "今度行われる学園のプロム……\nどうか、僕のお相手をしていただけませんか？", "zh": "下次举办的学园舞会……\n可以请您做我的舞伴吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0345_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0345_story_04_1005_019min", "source_sha256": "f6ec0b8eb2941af3162bce89dff89da03586ab5d8424fad08487804b8c3b0785", "ja": "……あ、もしかして私に言ってた？\n悪いけど、そういうの興味ないんだよね。", "zh": "……啊，难道是在跟我说话？\n不好意思，我对那种事没什么兴趣呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0345_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0345_story_04_1006_syoki", "source_sha256": "d2ed72a5a5fd2612268d99c0e730907e21b101098a535820ced932594e3cf1c4", "ja": "プロムには、どうかボクをパートナーに……\nお、お願いします！", "zh": "舞会时，请一定让我成为你的搭档……\n拜、拜托了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0345_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0345_story_04_1007_036kan", "source_sha256": "2ab906d6852917262b1ab449ea39919c9334f2107c673d36a8407ccb2be232b0", "ja": "ひゃっ！？　私がプロムのお相手なんて……\nえ、遠慮しておきます～！！", "zh": "呀！？让我来当舞会舞伴什么的……\n还、还是不用了～！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0345_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0345_story_04_1008_kantoku", "source_sha256": "a778642766c1432e8584026703ac5d3121b70f6c17abdbf67e6885ca8951bbea", "ja": "カット！　流石『I.V.』のみなさん、\nお芝居の方もバッチリですね！", "zh": "咔！不愧是『I.V.』的各位，演技也非常棒呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0345_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0345_story_04_1009_020meg", "source_sha256": "b65e6e72453a67b737e780402876ed5c05d5021c56c71c886ca80988e0d9934a", "ja": "……あれ？　もしかしてみんな、\nお芝居の経験あるの？　……ウソ！？", "zh": "……咦？难道大家都有演戏的经验吗？……不会吧！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0345_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0345_story_04_1010_017kth", "source_sha256": "b90fd512b6c6c85db3e3661fecccc42865573b004151faa1127c0bdccf6fde65", "ja": "最後は俺で～す！\nよろしくね、真珠星♪", "zh": "最后一个是我哦～！\n请多关照，珍珠星♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0345_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0345_story_04_1011_020meg", "source_sha256": "327f099a4893e7372fc85890784237c6c8285343e6077b8082083178c6ac4c59", "ja": "ゲッ。\nさ、さっきの……。", "zh": "糟、刚才那个……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0345_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0345_story_04_1012_kantoku", "source_sha256": "85d27034d3d190bfca6fa48754036bf04cc465286180bf25e19c00932464b375", "ja": "本番行きまーす！\nよーい……アクション！", "zh": "正式演出开始——！\n预备……Action！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0345_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0345_story_04_1013_017kth", "source_sha256": "c281ed57c2a867565d6d8d26c956dcc306ce7578b9db675bc2d3b7c611785632", "ja": "プロムの相手は選び放題の俺だけど、\nまさか当日、風邪を引かれちゃうなんてね……。", "zh": "我可是想选谁当舞伴都行的，没想到她居然在当天感冒了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0345_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0345_story_04_1014_017kth", "source_sha256": "79f4c32e6bf09c2ea60f7ccb7d445b5b383c69f1e56a06f6d06d6efb7c0851e3", "ja": "仕方ない、適当に探すか！\n……ねえ、そこのキミ！　ヒマそうだね？", "zh": "没办法，随便找个人吧！\n……喂，那边的你！看起来很闲嘛？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0345_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0345_story_04_1015_017kth", "source_sha256": "d52bf489e0c993931880592b85b5e2f337ed3d5bb701298da5c5d3a38812643f", "ja": "時間を持て余してるなら、俺とプロムに行かない？\n心配しなくても、楽しませてあげるよ！", "zh": "既然时间多得无聊，不如和我一起去参加舞会吧？\n别担心，我保证会让你玩得很开心的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0345_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0345_story_04_1016_020meg", "source_sha256": "4c99f91a303ccaa5505afbd23ffa4a2282074d10be152eab0572e9e29b36b28e", "ja": "ヒマそう……！？\nだ、誰がアンタなんかと……ムカちゅく！", "zh": "看起来很闲……！？\n谁、谁要和你这种人一起去……气死我了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0345_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0345_story_04_1017_kantoku", "source_sha256": "9be0bbf31aaa677bf5e07629b69616beb90c2af34b52d8c1c65b2c7332592da2", "ja": "カーーーット！\n真珠星さん、ちょっと嚙んじゃったね！", "zh": "咔——！\n真珠星，刚才稍微咬到舌头了呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0345_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0345_story_04_1018_017kth", "source_sha256": "8eb687bb7fefd5f5887bbc660fe22d049cd121b8f0cb100b7cccba8f4485555c", "ja": "あっはっはっ！　噛んじゃうとか！\nあの短い台詞で！", "zh": "啊哈哈哈！居然咬到舌头了！\n就那么短的一句台词！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0345_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0345_story_04_1019_020meg", "source_sha256": "d4bacc46db421a239360ff733e00ad410a5d409d0581a2e96871a01ef483bc05", "ja": "ぐっ……！", "zh": "唔……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0345_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0345_story_04_1020_kantoku", "source_sha256": "c620cec668c41a61af18860df37603b37737ba9a19fb939deff4080ef7dbbc12", "ja": "気を取り直して、もう一回いこうか！\nよーい、アクション！", "zh": "振作起来，再来一次吧！\n预备，开始！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0345_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0345_story_04_1021_017kth", "source_sha256": "d52bf489e0c993931880592b85b5e2f337ed3d5bb701298da5c5d3a38812643f", "ja": "時間を持て余してるなら、俺とプロムに行かない？\n心配しなくても、楽しませてあげるよ！", "zh": "既然时间多得无聊，不如和我一起去参加舞会吧？\n别担心，我保证会让你玩得很开心的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0345_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0345_story_04_1022_020meg", "source_sha256": "66d8d8e52228784fdc1d06876393ba589e2b0bec30b792bdfdbf12e4f1065369", "ja": "ヒマそう……！？\nだ、誰がアンタなんかと……ムカつくっ！！", "zh": "看起来很闲……！？\n谁、谁要和你这种人……气死我了！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0345_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0345_story_04_1023_kantoku", "source_sha256": "0a4ae211712dca7ad3dbd4fed3be9bdee5645781406e5a9bda4d1769a3ee2a89", "ja": "カット！　う～ん、今度は感情が入り過ぎかな～。\n殺意、もう少し控えめでお願い！", "zh": "咔！嗯——这次是不是感情投入过头了～。\n杀意请再收敛一点！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0345_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0345_story_04_1024_017kth", "source_sha256": "ca394fd3062e7e14da0c24df15b9aa9ae3a0676e882872519b75eb09ebb78389", "ja": "あっはっは！　殺意控えめ！　\nこの現場で初めて聞くディレクションかも！", "zh": "啊哈哈哈！收敛一点杀意！\n这可能还是我第一次在这个片场听到这样的指导！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0345_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0345_story_04_1025_017kth", "source_sha256": "d7978562d95ec469618f48c13fb92afc29e9c72e9ba1a225584d4c46229656d1", "ja": "やっぱ面白いな～、真珠星！", "zh": "果然很有意思呢～，真珠星！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0345_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0345_story_04_1026_020meg", "source_sha256": "432ba887732ebd75a4b0c37db9235d956c95bbd1c4ac4456566404bb88efaf50", "ja": "ぐ、ぐぬぬぅ……！", "zh": "咕、咕唔唔……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0345_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0345_story_04_1027_036kan", "source_sha256": "8e32ef20b23aeb418dbe5fa63b14cac24e62101d7e6cb5f02779c95d00b62c4d", "ja": "あの、藍さん、クロエさん。\n止めなくていいんですか……？", "zh": "那个，蓝小姐、克洛伊小姐。 \n不用阻止她们吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0345_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0345_story_04_1028_019min", "source_sha256": "aa7eef46d59b991957bb303ce65b3914b67aaf9059f87de5d8033cff72baa9b5", "ja": "放っておけば？　NGシーンもSNSに流せるし、\n話題になっていいんじゃない。", "zh": "别管不就好了？NG镜头也可以发到社交网络上，\n还能制造话题，挺不错的嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0345_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0345_story_04_1029_036kan", "source_sha256": "fdcf8910347e3a241e46d8738b0b4d9aa491c46f2fdb6639d082caea6ec7f0ea", "ja": "あ、えっと。湊くんの事務所は\nSNS関係厳しいところなので、無理かも……？", "zh": "啊，那个……凑的事务所对SNS相关的事情管得很严，可能不行……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0345_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0345_story_04_1030_018ele", "source_sha256": "b979974bb043fd6152bc2a59628f1ec7010433fbef3cc8f4b5c69e005cc08edd", "ja": "まぁ、現場で揉まれないとわからない事もあるし。\nそこまで心配するほどでもないでしょ。", "zh": "不过，有些事情不在现场历练一番，是不会明白的。没必要担心到那种程度吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0345_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0345_story_04_1031_036kan", "source_sha256": "c73dc742a049095e5a71938f88d53ce3389ed86bea1c87007a671bc00dfd405e", "ja": "……。\nそう、なら、いいんですけど……。", "zh": "……\n这样的话，那就没事了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0345_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0345_story_04_1032_null", "source_sha256": "79c62dc1ae38d3909e193a2ff6f302a2c77692892f87af8a8791891bfe4a95ed", "ja": "撮影終了後……", "zh": "拍摄结束后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0345_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0345_story_04_1033_020meg", "source_sha256": "076b77f66989a2a78a1f9c7eb7bd26908a218bcee1935b9f8fc9556546c91a76", "ja": "疲れた……。ダンスとか、\n歌のレッスンの数倍は疲れた……。", "zh": "累死了……拍摄什么的，\n比跳舞或者上声乐课累好几倍……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0345_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0345_story_04_1034_017kth", "source_sha256": "e8b480b1fc1393680518ca1d74c53a1ce1f5da94f7368b22bf9945fa65f222ad", "ja": "真珠星、お疲れ～！\n初めてにしては、まあまあだったんじゃない？", "zh": "珍珠星，辛苦啦～！\n第一次来说，表现得还不错吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0345_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0345_story_04_1035_020meg", "source_sha256": "8bd74ef78bf6711718cd5f0ab9825b1c42b7a53f91e12ab6383060fca61c7847", "ja": "……どうも。", "zh": "……谢谢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0345_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0345_story_04_1036_017kth", "source_sha256": "4c715ef2c9e7e563e4892f0cf4630e981650fd10fbd79c919953d58b197adec0", "ja": "ねね、連絡先教えてよ。", "zh": "那个，告诉我你的联系方式嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0345_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0345_story_04_1037_020meg", "source_sha256": "ef7e48e484a6171e38c64deac7f6855e62de9c93b101560b628f0b705105255f", "ja": "は？　連絡先？\nアイドルが教える訳ないでしょ。", "zh": "哈？联系方式？\n偶像怎么可能把联系方式告诉你。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
